msgstr "Habilitar Método"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:249
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Habilitar"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:254
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Título"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:256
msgid "Payment method name displayed on Checkout page."
msgstr "Nome do método de pagamento exibido na página de checkout."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:257
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:34
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:38
msgid "Pay with Bitcoin"
msgstr "Pagar com Bitcoin"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:260
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrição"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:262
msgid "Payment method description displayed on Checkout page."
msgstr "Descrição do método de pagamento exibida na página de checkout."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:263
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:35
msgid ""
"Pay directly from your Bitcoin wallet. Place your order to view the QR code "
"and payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Pague diretamente da sua carteira Bitcoin. Coloque o pedido para visualizar "
"o código QR e as instruções de pagamento."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:267
msgid "Express Payment (One-Click)"
msgstr "Pagamento Expresso (Um Clique)"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:268
msgid ""
"Enable Express Payment to pay with one click. When enabled, customers are "
"redirected straight to the payment QR code."
msgstr ""
"Habilite o Pagamento Expresso para pagar com um clique. Quando habilitado, "
"os clientes são redirecionados diretamente para o código QR de pagamento."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:271
msgid "Enable Express Payment"
msgstr "Habilitar Pagamento Expresso"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:277
msgid "Express Button Label"
msgstr "Rótulo do Botão Expresso"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:278
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:42
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:47
msgid "Buy with"
msgstr "Comprar com"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:279
msgid ""
"Text displayed on the Express Payment button. If empty, the default label "
"will be used 'Buy with'"
msgstr ""
"Texto exibido no botão de Pagamento Expresso. Se vazio, o rótulo padrão "
"\"Comprar com\" será usado."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:286
msgid "Express Button Icon"
msgstr "Ícone do Botão Expresso"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:287
msgid "Show icon on Express Payment button"
msgstr "Mostrar ícone no botão de Pagamento Expresso"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:290
msgid ""
"When enabled, the payment network icon is displayed alongside the button "
"label."
msgstr ""
"Quando habilitado, o ícone da rede de pagamento é exibido ao lado do rótulo "
"do botão."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:293
msgid "Icon Position"
msgstr "Posição do Ícone"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:296
msgid ""
"Controls where the icon appears relative to the button label. e.g. \"₿ Pay "
"with\" (left) or \"Pay with ₿\" (right)."
msgstr ""
"Controla onde o ícone aparece em relação ao rótulo do botão. Ex: \"₿ Pagar "
"com\" (esquerda) ou \"Pagar com ₿\" (direita)."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:298
msgid "Left — icon before label"
msgstr "Esquerda — ícone antes do rótulo"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:299
msgid "Right — icon after label"
msgstr "Direita — ícone após o rótulo"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:307
msgid "Hide for Non-Admin Users"
msgstr "Ocultar para Usuários Não Administradores"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:308
msgid "Show only for administrators."
msgstr "Mostrar apenas para administradores."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:311
msgid ""
"If enabled, only administrators will see the payment method on Checkout page."
msgstr ""
"Se habilitado, apenas administradores verão o método de pagamento na página "
"de checkout."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:314
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Depuração"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:315
msgid "Enable debugging messages"
msgstr "Habilitar mensagens de depuração"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:318
msgid "Debug logs will be saved to WooCommerce > Status > Logs."
msgstr "Os logs de depuração serão salvos em WooCommerce > Status > Logs."

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:322
msgid "Support the development!"
msgstr "Apoie o desenvolvimento!"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:328
msgid "<strong>Enjoying the plugin?</strong> Send some BTC to support:"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Está gostando do plugin?</strong> Envie alguns BTC para apoiar:"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:331
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#. translators: %s is the payment gateway's title, e.g. "Bitcoin Payments (On-Chain)".
#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:416
#, php-format
msgid "%s is enabled but hidden from checkout:"
msgstr "%s está ativado, mas oculto na finalização da compra:"

#: includes/abstract-class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:566
msgid "Premium · Coming soon"
msgstr "Premium · Em breve"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:28
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:35
msgid "Bitcoin Payments"
msgstr "Pagamentos em Bitcoin"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:28
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:364
msgid "Lightning Network"
msgstr "Lightning Network"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:29
msgid "Accept Bitcoin payments self-hosted via Lightning Network"
msgstr "Aceite pagamentos em Bitcoin auto-hospedados via Lightning Network"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:29
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:36
msgid "Provided by PayCrypto.Me"
msgstr "Fornecido por PayCrypto.Me"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:106
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Configurações de Proxy"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:108
msgid "Configure proxy settings for connecting to your Lightning node."
msgstr "Configure as configurações de proxy para conectar ao seu nó Lightning."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:111
msgid "Lightning Node Type"
msgstr "Tipo de Nó Lightning"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:116
msgid "Invoice Expiry"
msgstr "Expiração da Fatura"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:118
msgid ""
"Time before invoice expires. Min: 300 (5 min), Max: 86400 (24h). Default: "
"3600 (1 hour)"
msgstr ""
"Tempo antes da fatura expirar. Mín: 300 (5 min), Máx: 86400 (24h). Padrão: "
"3600 (1 hora)"

#. translators: %s: field label, e.g. "BTCPay Server URL".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:129
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:386
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:39
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:45
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:51
msgid "BTCPay Server URL"
msgstr "URL do Servidor BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:131
msgid "Full URL to your BTCPay Server (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "URL completa do seu Servidor BTCPay (HTTPS obrigatório)."

#. translators: 1: field label, e.g. "BTCPay API Key". 2: minimum length.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:138
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:387
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:72
msgid "BTCPay API Key"
msgstr "Chave API do BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:140
msgid "API key for BTCPay (min 20 characters)."
msgstr "Chave API do BTCPay (mín 20 caracteres)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:146
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:388
msgid "BTCPay Store ID"
msgstr "ID da Loja BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:148
msgid "Your BTCPay store identifier."
msgstr "Identificador da sua loja BTCPay."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:153
msgid "BTCPay Lightning Payment Method ID (advanced)"
msgstr "ID do Método de Pagamento Lightning do BTCPay (avançado)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:155
msgid ""
"Only change this if your BTCPay Server version reports a different Lightning "
"payment method identifier than the default. Leave as \"BTC-LN\" unless "
"instructed otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Altere apenas se a sua versão do Servidor BTCPay reportar um identificador "
"de método de pagamento Lightning diferente do padrão. Deixe como \"BTC-LN\" "
"a menos que instruído de outra forma."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:162
msgid "BTCPay Connection Test"
msgstr "Teste de Conexão do BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:167
msgid "Webhook Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Webhook"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:169
msgid ""
"Automatic payment confirmation via webhooks (BTCPay push / lnd polling) "
"ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me Premium add-on. In the free version, "
"Lightning payments are confirmed manually — the settings below are a preview "
"and are not editable yet."
msgstr ""
"A confirmação automática de pagamento via webhooks (push do BTCPay / polling "
"do lnd) chega no futuro add-on Premium do PayCrypto.Me. Na versão gratuita, "
"os pagamentos via Lightning são confirmados manualmente — as configurações "
"abaixo são apenas uma prévia e ainda não são editáveis."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:172
msgid "BTCPay Webhook Secret"
msgstr "Segredo do Webhook do BTCPay"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:174
msgid "Reserved for the Premium add-on. Not used by the free version."
msgstr "Reservado para o add-on Premium. Não utilizado na versão gratuita."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:175
msgid "Available in the Premium add-on"
msgstr "Disponível no add-on Premium"

#. translators: %s: field label, e.g. "BTCPay Server URL".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:183
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:382
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:70
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:106
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:112
msgid "lnd REST URL"
msgstr "URL REST do lnd"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:185
msgid "REST API endpoint (HTTPS required)."
msgstr "Ponto de extremidade da API REST (HTTPS obrigatório)."

#. translators: 1: field label, e.g. "BTCPay API Key". 2: minimum length.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:192
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:383
#: includes/validators/class-lightning-config-validator.php:125
msgid "lnd Macaroon (hex)"
msgstr "Macaroon do lnd (hexadecimal)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:194
msgid "Admin macaroon in hexadecimal format (min 100 characters)."
msgstr "Macaroon de administrador em formato hexadecimal (mín 100 caracteres)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:200
msgid "SSL Certificate (PEM)"
msgstr "Certificado SSL (PEM)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:202
msgid ""
"Optional: Paste your SSL certificate in PEM format. If provided, this will "
"be used for verification instead of disabling SSL checks."
msgstr ""
"Opcional: Cole seu certificado SSL em formato PEM. Se fornecido, será usado "
"para verificação em vez de desabilitar verificações de SSL."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:208
msgid "Verify SSL Certificate"
msgstr "Verificar Certificado SSL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:210
msgid "Enable SSL certificate verification"
msgstr "Habilitar verificação de certificado SSL"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:211
msgid ""
"Enable for production. If disabled and no certificate is provided, SSL "
"verification is skipped (development only)."
msgstr ""
"Habilite para produção. Se desabilitado e nenhum certificado fornecido, a "
"verificação de SSL é ignorada (apenas desenvolvimento)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:216
msgid "lnd REST Connection Test"
msgstr "Teste de Conexão REST do lnd"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:283
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:319
msgid "🔌 Test connection"
msgstr "🔌 Testar conexão"

#. translators: 1: settings field label, 2: selected Lightning node type.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me-lightning.php:395
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is empty, and it is required for the selected node type (%2$s)."
msgstr "%1$s está vazio e é obrigatório para o tipo de nó selecionado (%2$s)."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:35
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:365
msgid "On-Chain"
msgstr "Rede Blockchain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:36
msgid "Accept Bitcoin payments Non-custodial via On-Chain"
msgstr "Aceite pagamentos em Bitcoin não-custodiais via Rede Blockchain"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:39
msgid ""
"Use directly your Bitcoin wallet to pay. Place the order to view the QR code "
"and payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"Use sua carteira Bitcoin diretamente para pagar. Coloque o pedido para "
"visualizar o código QR e as instruções de pagamento."

#. translators: 1: list of missing PHP extensions, e.g. "GMP". 2: bech32 address prefix, e.g. "bc1".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:75
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This server is missing the PHP %1$s extension, which is required to derive "
"addresses from an xPub. Ask your host to enable it, or configure a single "
"fixed address starting with %2$s instead."
msgstr ""
"Este servidor não tem a extensão PHP %1$s, necessária para derivar endereços "
"a partir de um xPub. Peça à sua hospedagem para ativá-la ou configure, em "
"vez disso, um único endereço fixo começando com %2$s."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:82
msgid "No network is selected in the gateway settings."
msgstr "Nenhuma rede está selecionada nas configurações do gateway."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:86
msgid ""
"No wallet xPub or Bitcoin address is configured in the gateway settings."
msgstr ""
"Nenhum xPub de carteira ou endereço Bitcoin está configurado nas "
"configurações do gateway."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:146
msgid "This server cannot derive addresses from an extended public key."
msgstr ""
"Este servidor não consegue derivar endereços a partir de uma chave pública "
"estendida."

#. translators: 1: list of missing PHP extensions, e.g. "GMP". 2: bech32 address prefix, e.g. "bc1".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:149
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The PHP %1$s extension is not installed, so an xPub/yPub/zPub cannot be used "
"here — ask your host to enable it. You can still accept on-chain payments "
"right now by entering a single fixed address starting with %2$s in the field "
"below; every order is then paid to that same address, which is worse for "
"privacy but works without the extension."
msgstr ""
"A extensão PHP %1$s não está instalada, então um xPub/yPub/zPub não pode ser "
"usado aqui — peça à sua hospedagem para ativá-la. Você ainda pode receber "
"pagamentos on-chain agora mesmo informando no campo abaixo um único endereço "
"fixo começando com %2$s; nesse caso todos os pedidos são pagos nesse mesmo "
"endereço, o que é pior para a privacidade, mas funciona sem a extensão."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:170
#: includes/services/class-lightning-connection-tester.php:128
msgid "Permission denied."
msgstr "Permissão negada."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:179
msgid "Reset failed. Check WooCommerce logs for details."
msgstr "Falha na redefinição. Verifique os logs do WooCommerce para detalhes."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:185
msgid "Reset request received."
msgstr "Solicitação de redefinição recebida."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:193
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:198
msgid "Security check failed"
msgstr "Falha na verificação de segurança"

#. translators: %s is the field label being validated, e.g. "Wallet xPub".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:210
#, php-format
msgid "Please enter a valid %s."
msgstr "Por favor, digite um %s válido."

#. translators: %s: the underlying error message.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:233
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The wallet key could not be validated because of an internal error: %s. "
"Nothing was saved. This is not a problem with the key you entered."
msgstr ""
"Não foi possível validar a chave da carteira por causa de um erro interno: "
"%s. Nada foi salvo. Isso não é um problema da chave que você digitou."

#. translators: 1: network the key actually belongs to, 2: network selected in settings.
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:242
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This key belongs to %1$s, but the selected network is %2$s. Please provide a "
"key for the selected network."
msgstr ""
"Esta chave pertence a %1$s, mas a rede selecionada é %2$s. Forneça uma chave "
"para a rede selecionada."

#. translators: %s is the field label being validated, e.g. "Wallet xPub".
#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:248
#, php-format
msgid "The %s provided is not valid for the selected network."
msgstr "O %s fornecido não é válido para a rede selecionada."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:265
msgid "Wallet xPub"
msgstr "xPub da Carteira"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:274
msgid "Testnet Wallet xPub"
msgstr "xPub da Carteira Testnet"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:289
msgid "Network Identifier"
msgstr "Identificador de Rede"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:293
msgid ""
"Tip: It is always preferable to use the wallet xPub rather than a wallet "
"address for Bitcoin payments."
msgstr ""
"Dica: É sempre preferível usar o xPub da carteira em vez de um endereço de "
"carteira para pagamentos em Bitcoin."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:297
msgid "Payment Timeout (hours)"
msgstr "Tempo Limite de Pagamento (horas)"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:299
msgid ""
"Automatic order expiry after the timeout ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Premium add-on. In the free version, on-chain addresses stay valid until "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"A expiração automática do pedido após o tempo limite chega no futuro add-on "
"Premium do PayCrypto.Me. Na versão gratuita, os endereços on-chain "
"permanecem válidos até o pagamento."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:305
msgid "Payment number of confirmations"
msgstr "Número de confirmações do pagamento"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:307
msgid ""
"Automatic on-chain confirmation tracking ships in the upcoming PayCrypto.Me "
"Premium add-on. In the free version, payments are verified manually."
msgstr ""
"O acompanhamento automático de confirmações on-chain chega no futuro add-on "
"Premium do PayCrypto.Me. Na versão gratuita, os pagamentos são verificados "
"manualmente."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:314
msgid "Danger Area"
msgstr "Zona de Perigo"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:317
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Aviso:"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:317
msgid ""
"Resetting the payment derivation index will lead to the reuse of addresses "
"and loss of past data. Proceed with caution and ensure you understand the "
"implications."
msgstr ""
"Redefinir o índice de derivação de pagamento levará à reutilização de "
"endereços e perda de dados anteriores. Proceda com cautela e certifique-se "
"de entender as implicações."

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:319
msgid "Reset payment address derivation index"
msgstr "Redefinir índice de derivação de endereço de pagamento"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:366
msgid "Testnet"
msgstr "Testnet"

#: includes/class-wc-gateway-paycrypto-me.php:492
msgid ""
"A fixed Bitcoin address was saved. Payments will work, but every order is "
"paid to this same address. For better privacy, we recommend using an "
"extended public key (xpub/ypub/zpub) instead, which automatically creates a "
"new address for each order."
msgstr ""
